      "system": {
        "description": "<p>An otyugh\u2019s bite carries a nasty disease called filth fever. Filth fever\u2014bite: @Check[save:fort|dc:16]{Fortitude save (DC 16)} negates; incubation period 1d3 days; initial and secondary damage 1d3 Dex and 1d3 Con.</p>",
